Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - Michael on Stage}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:07.41,0:00:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's so irresistibly adorable!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.94,0:00:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine life without a cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.36,0:00:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I even feed the stray cats in my neighborhood.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.79,0:00:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I think cats are humans.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.56,0:00:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Therefore, we should treat \N them just like humans.{\i0}
Comment: 10,0:00:24.29,0:00:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.79,0:00:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,See, Michael? Everyone loves you!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.16,0:00:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.43,0:00:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.84,0:00:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How was the meeting?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.10,0:00:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nailed it!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.44,0:00:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.96,0:00:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor Sugai has written many books\N about cats, including {\i1}Our Beloved Cats{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.28,0:00:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what can I say? I just love them.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.88,0:00:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Maiko-chan, weren't you also featured in a magazine recently? {likely a parody of https://jpop.fandom.com/wiki/Okamoto_Maiko }
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.32,0:00:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I was!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.12,0:00:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is, "The Cat I Love."
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.82,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Maiko-chan is keeping a wonderful chinchilla cat. Isn't it cute? {https://felinefancy.co.uk/blogs/cat-breeds-info/chinchilla}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.20,0:01:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. You're making me blush!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.83,0:01:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Monja-san, you're also famous for centering many of your songs around cats. {very specific name and appearances but I'm not finding anyone like that; if he's based on a real person, idk who it is}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.12,0:01:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Back in the days before I made it big, \NI took care of a female cat named Hanako.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.74,0:01:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Whenever I was stumped composing, \NHanako always comforted and encouraged me.{\i0} {stuck}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:27.64,0:01:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, my landlord absolutely hated cats.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.96,0:01:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Abandon Hanako or move out?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.73,0:01:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was forced to choose one.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.00,0:01:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And being in the depths of poverty, \NI had no choice, really!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.62,0:01:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,P-Please forgive me, Hanako...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.53,0:01:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.05,0:01:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,To this day, it pains me to recall the lonely \N look in Hanako's eyes as she watched me leave.{Hanako's lonely eyes as she watched \Nme leave hurt me to this day!}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.69,0:02:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanako!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.39,0:02:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That must've been hard for you...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.29,0:02:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that's what others have to go through. I feel sorry for Monja.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.10,0:02:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Monja? Oh yeah, look. \NThe editorial department gave me this.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.57,0:02:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Monja Special?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.54,0:02:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, a concert ticket?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.44,0:02:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, your stories today have been truly moving, \Nbut unfortunately, we're out of time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.48,0:02:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much\N for coming today, everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.98,0:02:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, on {\i1}I Love Cats{\i0}, fellow cat owners, {lit: cat tribe}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.05,0:02:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mizuki Maiko-chan, an idol singer who is famous for her love of cats...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.96,0:02:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Cappi! {"cute" inflection of "Happy"}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.92,0:02:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The writer Sugai Minoru-sensei,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.29,0:02:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and singer-songwriter Monja-san, joined us as our guests!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.25,0:02:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.76,0:02:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,See you next week!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.22,0:02:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Hey, it's tonight!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.58,0:02:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's been a while since we \Nwent to a concert together.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.24,0:02:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true. That Monja really seems to be a cat person, so it might be interesting.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.64,0:02:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.03,0:03:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought, \Nso even for 8,000 yen...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.55,0:03:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,8,000? Didn't they give it to you for free?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.85,0:03:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.32,0:03:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.66,0:03:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You know I couldn't refuse.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.08,0:03:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.23,0:03:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like I had no choice!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.76,0:03:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.78,0:03:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,, {??? no, I mean...}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.13,0:03:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, good job, everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.97,0:03:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.33,0:03:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a concert?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.42,0:03:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, after the program today.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.21,0:03:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, if you'd like to come, \NI'll reserve some seats for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.14,0:03:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.54,0:03:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to take him up on it, Maiko-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.71,0:03:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.93,0:03:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh hey, thanks, everyone! I mean it.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.85,0:03:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you all, \Nit was a great program.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.08,0:03:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.52,0:03:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure! {actually "good job/thanks for your work"}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.56,0:03:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.62,0:03:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say, I've been the host \Nof this program for years,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.31,0:03:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's rare when {\i1}all{\i0} of our guests \Nlike cats {\i1}this{\i0} much! {??}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.66,0:03:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Monja-san, your story alone \Nbrought tears to my eyes.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.25,0:03:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.68,0:03:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's nothing...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.37,0:03:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the name of your chinchilla, Maiko-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.76,0:04:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, right...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.01,0:04:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the truth is... I don't have a cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.85,0:04:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! But there's a photo in the magazine!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.99,0:04:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That's my friend's cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.49,0:04:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I like cats, but I've never owned one.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.43,0:04:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just reading from\N the scenario given to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.96,0:04:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Then, everything you said on the show was a lie?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.27,0:04:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But my manager told me to do that.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.27,0:04:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Maiko-chan, there's nothing \Nto worry about. It's the same for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.44,0:04:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm allergic to fur.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.48,0:04:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just thinking that a cat \Nmight be nearby gives me hives.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.65,0:04:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It itches even to just remember it!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.20,0:04:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious! \NWhat is this book, then?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.29,0:04:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our Beloved Cats{\i0}. Didn't you write it?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.96,0:04:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That's still nothing.
Comment: 10,0:04:55.30,0:04:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.93,0:04:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Don't tell me your story w-was a lie too?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.43,0:05:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I really did abandon my cat, Hanako.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.47,0:05:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But in reality,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.54,0:05:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,she came back a month later, \Nthin and exhausted.
Comment: 10,0:05:09.78,0:05:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{O-Oh...}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.81,0:05:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Good for you!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.05,0:05:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so? That must've been moving.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.28,0:05:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.42,0:05:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't stop myself from crying \Nand hugged her as hard as I could.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.34,0:05:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And? What then?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.41,0:05:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? And then...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.00,0:05:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I carried her further away \Nand abandoned her again! {threw her away in a further place}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.03,0:05:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.40,0:05:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you people bother\N to show up for our show?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.21,0:05:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, my program, my job...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.66,0:05:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you come here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:56.86,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? \NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.86,0:05:59.23,Song,,0,0,0,,You too will be number one someday
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.23,0:06:02.80,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael?\NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.80,0:06:05.87,Song,,0,0,0,,Now which one is number one? {???}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.87,0:06:08.08,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? Number one!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.34,0:06:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, dear! It's starting already!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.04,0:06:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.68,0:06:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.95,0:06:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so easygoing!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.93,0:06:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.42,0:06:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, right, you wanna eat somewhere when this is over? I'm paying.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.25,0:06:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Fine, then I'll have the full course of French cuisine. Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.22,0:06:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.03,0:06:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.27,0:06:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! When did you sneak in?! Get out! {??}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.75,0:06:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse us.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.42,0:07:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.15,0:07:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This next song holds\N a special meaning for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.73,0:07:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,"The Cat Grub Song"! {nekomanma = dish of rice and miso soup or dried bonito flakes; cat food - a very simple dish, basically rice mixed with leftovers for cats; don't think there's a way to differentiate it in english, where it's all just "cat food"}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.43,0:07:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to hear it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.14,0:07:21.46,Song,,0,0,0,,Crab, fish paste{kamaboko; steamed seasoned fish paste, usu. in a semicylindrical shape on a strip of wood and sliced to go in soup, etc.}, fish cake{chikuwa; tube-shaped fish paste cake​}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.46,0:07:25.85,Song,,0,0,0,,Chicken breast with egg on top
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.85,0:07:29.45,Song,,0,0,0,,A special treat of tuna, dry food {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.45,0:07:31.89,Song,,0,0,0,,But today…
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.29,0:07:34.99,Song,,0,0,0,,It's just cat grub {nekomanma}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.99,0:07:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you! Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.56,0:07:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.59,0:07:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.48,0:07:50.77,Song,,0,0,0,,Smoked bonito, dried sardines, trimmed head and tail
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.00,0:07:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A cat?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.77,0:07:54.48,Song,,0,0,0,,Fancy canned food, even jerky too {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.48,0:07:57.06,Song,,0,0,0,,But once again, today…
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.35,0:08:00.53,Song,,0,0,0,,It’s just cat grub
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.41,0:07:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? M-Mich—
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.41,0:08:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There, come here, little guy!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.53,0:08:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so funny!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.53,0:08:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh... Whatever, just go now! {??}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.25,0:08:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.69,0:08:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.26,0:08:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear, do you think... {??? ano, anata?}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.43,0:08:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! It's back again!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.26,0:08:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you let it go? Why?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.94,0:08:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.17,0:08:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.88,0:08:33.60,Song,,0,0,0,,Bonito slices, cat powder
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.60,0:08:36.93,Song,,0,0,0,,Sea bream, mackerel {Pacific saury}{?? dunno what's that kirame}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.29,0:08:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.92,0:08:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Nicely done!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.03,0:08:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's looking this way!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.24,0:08:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.48,0:09:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.52,0:09:08.08,Song,,0,0,0,,Cat croquettes, white fish, salmon flakes {??????? no clue what a single of the items here is, just making some up; sounds kinda like cat actions and not food}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.55,0:09:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.03,0:09:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.08,0:09:10.93,Song,,0,0,0,,But even tomorrow...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.82,0:09:13.90,Song,,0,0,0,,It's just cat grub
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.63,0:09:29.15,Song,,0,0,0,,Crab, fish paste{kamaboko; steamed seasoned fish paste, usu. in a semicylindrical shape on a strip of wood and sliced to go in soup, etc.}, fish cake{chikuwa; tube-shaped fish paste cake​}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.15,0:09:33.12,Song,,0,0,0,,Chicken breast with egg on top
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.17,0:09:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Adorable!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.12,0:09:36.74,Song,,0,0,0,,A special treat of tuna, dry food {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.74,0:09:39.75,Song,,0,0,0,,But today...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.81,0:09:42.50,Song,,0,0,0,,It's just cat grub
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.76,0:09:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you! Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.34,0:09:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.31,0:09:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Encore! Encore!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.75,0:09:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.07,0:10:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Encore! Encore!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.69,0:10:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you! Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.74,0:10:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I have to do it...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.19,0:10:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Encore!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.28,0:10:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{??? maybe "Ah, he's here again!"}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.16,0:10:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.44,0:10:11.55,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Encore!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.55,0:10:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Encore!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.63,0:10:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Comment: 10,0:10:22.26,0:10:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nyaa?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.02,0:10:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{yay encore? kawaii?}
Comment: 10,0:10:24.97,0:10:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.94,0:10:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.73,0:10:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you! Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.76,0:10:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(0,0)\p1\c&H0&}m 0 0 l 640 0 640 480 0 480
Comment: 0,0:10:39.12,0:10:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter  - The Fearsome Catzilla}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.65,0:10:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please evacuate quickly!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.30,0:10:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Catzilla is coming! Hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.33,0:11:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,To everyone watching, a giant Catzilla has \N suddenly appeared on the streets of Tokyo!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.17,0:11:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's hear from Nekobayashi-san, \Nwho is currently reporting from the scene! {literally "cat forest"}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.71,0:11:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nekobayashi-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.93,0:11:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! I'm on the scene right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.28,0:11:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.25,0:11:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The tank corps has just been dispatched!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.99,0:12:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.79,0:12:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,F-Fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.93,0:12:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Multiple hits! {meaning that they hit the target squarely}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.79,0:12:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! But Catzilla is perfectly fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.75,0:12:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! The tank corps's been wiped out!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.22,0:12:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Catzilla is terrifying!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.07,0:12:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The terrifying Catzilla!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.31,0:12:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Fighter aircraft have been dispatched!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.91,0:12:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.36,0:13:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! It was downed immediately!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.95,0:13:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The fighter squadron was wiped out as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.89,0:13:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Catzilla is terrifying!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.02,0:13:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The terrifying Catzilla!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.26,0:13:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Catzilla continues its rampage through the city.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.67,0:13:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! It looks like she's heading \Nfor the baseball field.
Comment: 10,0:13:24.74,0:13:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.74,0:13:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{?? something about nyajira}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.63,0:13:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{Help!}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.13,0:13:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But why on Earth would Catzilla \Nenter a baseball field?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.55,0:13:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Could it be...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.79,0:13:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! We apologize to everyone \Nwho's been eating!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.60,0:13:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are looking truly grim now.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.38,0:13:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the city of Tokyo... No, all of Japan is going to turn into Catzilla's playground! {??? nyajira no *** ga mama ni}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.02,0:14:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Catzilla is terrifying!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.64,0:14:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The terrifying Catzilla!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.30,0:14:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Dear viewers, this is goodbye!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.02,0:14:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.29,0:14:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh! You've gone too far, Catzilla!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.95,0:14:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.78,0:14:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Michael Cat! {calque of superman}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.65,0:14:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Michael Cat!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.32,0:14:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael Cat has come to save us!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.06,0:14:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He will fight Catzilla for us!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.47,0:15:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! He's dancing away!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.34,0:15:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back, you bastard!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.44,0:15:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.26,0:15:54.08,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? \NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.08,0:15:56.45,Song,,0,0,0,,You too will be number one someday
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.45,0:16:00.02,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael?\NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.02,0:16:03.09,Song,,0,0,0,,Now which one is number one? {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.09,0:16:08.90,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? Number one! \NWhat's Michael? Number one!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.28,0:16:10.31,Song,,0,0,0,,{chapter - Poppo's Story}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.51,0:16:21.25,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Today I'm going to tell you about \N when my mate Poppo was a kitten. {/sweetheart}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.25,0:16:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,P-Please! Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.84,0:16:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late now.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.38,0:16:56.30,Thought,,0,0,0,,A stray cat!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.03,0:17:13.48,Thought,,0,0,0,,So cute...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.71,0:17:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me some dried bonito! {namaribushi = boiled and half-dried bonito}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.18,0:17:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Certainly!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.98,0:17:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.85,0:17:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.97,0:17:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at this kitten!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.47,0:17:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.33,0:17:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we give it some cheese?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.96,0:17:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she'll eat it?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.56,0:17:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme just a minute.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.20,0:17:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, won't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.47,0:17:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! She ate the cheese!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.90,0:17:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Her stomach's rumbling! {??}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.47,0:17:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me hear it too!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.41,0:17:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! These tiny paws are just adorable!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.66,0:18:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, her ears are cute too!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.08,0:18:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Her tail is so long!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.58,0:18:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, she’s sticking her tongue out!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.95,0:18:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{??}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.26,0:18:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{ah, cute}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.57,0:18:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, bye now, kitty.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.09,0:18:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.66,0:18:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.40,0:18:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.01,0:18:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, aren’t you a cute little kitty?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.35,0:18:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get you something.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.22,0:18:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You like that? Eat slowly.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.20,0:19:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye now, kitty. Grow up healthy.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.21,0:19:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.82,0:19:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss! {aniki = big bro in mafia}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.25,0:19:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.57,0:19:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought some dried bonito \Nand wanted to eat it at home. {namaribushi}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.97,0:19:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Dried bonito?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.54,0:19:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.81,0:19:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Boss!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.29,0:20:28.98,Thought,,0,0,0,,C-Cute...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.97,0:20:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to endure it for now!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.74,0:21:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,S-So cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.15,0:21:16.41,Narrator,,0,0,0,,What do you think?\N Isn’t my mewate Poppo cute? {mate/sweetheart}
Comment: 0,0:21:16.41,0:21:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{Nyaa~}
